Usage: $CLI_NAME upgrade [options]

Options:
  --name NAME         Container name (default: agent-<dir>)
  --new-name NAME     New container name after recreation (default: preserve existing name)
  --copy              Create the target as a copy and keep the source container unchanged (requires --new-name)
  --image NAME        Image to use for recreation (default: existing container image)
  --workdir PATH      Host directory to mount at /workdir after recreation (default: preserve existing mount source)
  --cpu NUM           CPU cores for recreated container (default: preserve existing setting)
  --mem SIZE          Memory limit for recreated container (default: preserve existing setting)
  --shm-size SIZE     Size of /dev/shm for recreated container (default: preserve explicit existing setting)
  --network NAME      Replace preserved network attachments (repeatable)
  --mount-socket HOST_PATH:CONTAINER_PATH  Add or replace a socket mapping (repeatable)
